xt at or under `max` is returned unchanged.\n- Longer text is cut to `max - 1` characters plus `…`, so the result is exactly `max` characters.\n- For `max` of 0 or less, the result is an empty string. Without that guard, `slice(0, -1)` would return the wrong length. This is my choice for the edge case, since the request didn't cover it.\n- Length is counted in UTF-16 code units, as JavaScript's `.length` does. Characters outside the Basic Multilingual Plane, such as most emoji, count as 2.\n\nI didn't commit anything. I also didn't run the project's test suite, since I didn't check for one.","ttft_ms":2294,"type":"result","duration_ms":8530,"uuid":"2cfe517e-26e7-4730-b1f2-d79a937ffcad","ttft_stream_ms":1817,"time_to_request_ms":452,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":7,"system_prompt":360,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":13,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":1,"tool_pool_refresh":2,"init_message":3,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":6,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":16,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":16,"request_build":9},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":9,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":120,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":206,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":128,"process_rss_mib_result":228,"process_anon_mib_result":136,"process_peak_rss_mib":234,"process_cpu_ms_turn":732,"process_wall_ms_turn":8529,"tool_pool_build_count":3,"tool_pool_build_lapsed_count":0,"tool_pool_moved_at_lapse_count":0,"tool_pool_limit_ms":30000,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":158,"process_wall_ms_streaming":4226,"main_stream_count":4,"main_stream_event_count":173,"main_stream_chunk_count":129,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":158,"wall_ms":4226,"entries":4},"tool":{"cpu_ms":95,"wall_ms":149,"entries":3},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":289,"wall_ms":3640,"entr